      "id": "462961cb-dcaf-4fff-adf2-d3a0854813ce",
      "name": "Property",
      "description": {
        "content": "A **Property** is the real-estate asset a **Project** is carried out on, holding its address and location. A project references one property, and the same property can back several projects. Properties can be created and updated through the API.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
